  "description": "AFFECTED1 AUTHOR CANDIDATE ONLY: ellipse x^2+9y^2=81 on the original 38 by 12 unit grid. Closed extrema (-9,0),(9,0),(0,3),(0,-3) were independently observed before reading the historical failed spec. Reuses that actual spec, correcting its raw-path coordinate units for the current renderer and replacing zero-size visibility assumptions with explicit hidden construction anchors. Axis labels use fixed clearance. Clean typography, finite frame and pale regularized grid are modern presentation choices. Source inventory seal: /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/.tmp/resume182-6-8a-n7-figures3695-AFFECTED1/sourceinventory.record; SHA-256 dce1e711d85d15a5b2ef748311947c3e68032c2dc69af00e9205fd60eda6cb3c. Current context: /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/.tmp/resume182-6-8a-n7-figure-context3695-AFFECTED1/fig-14.context.json; SHA-256 5690aae14fb55d00437f2e462b768040fb44a7c24bb6ddcfbdfa6a28b55a514a. Historical first-visual-FAIL remains immutable. No candidate visual inspection, independent review, promotion or lesson approval.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8a/figures/fig-14.png",
      "sha256": "c2d2f17ea8f6f19adf4f617e29b6cfad17833f79ecc18496ad587cdba984df05"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n7",
        "text": "在图14中画出了方程$x^2+9y^2=81$的图象，这种形式的曲线叫做椭圆."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n7",
        "text": "每一个含两个变量$x$和$y$的方程，都确定某一个作为这个方程的解的变量取值数对$(x,y)$的集合，也就是都在变量$x$的值和变量$y$的值之间建立某种关系. 大家知道，二元方程给出的关系的图象，或简称为二元方程的图象，是以这个方程的解为坐标的平面上点的集合."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n7",
        "text": "我们知道，$ax+by=c(a\\ne0$或$b\\ne0)$这种形式的方程的图象是直线，$y=ax^2+bx+c(a\\ne0)$这种形式的方程的图象是抛物线，$xy=k(k\\ne0)$这种形式的方程的图象是双曲线."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n7",
        "text": "图14"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n7",
        "text": "我们来看图15，图中画出了圆心在坐标原点、半径为5个单位长的圆周. 我们来求图象是这个圆周的方程."
      }
    ],
